  "term": "FAS",
  "definition": "FAS stands for Functional Acuity Score, a standardized score derived from visual acuity data as part of a broader functional vision evaluation. It is combined with the Functional Field Score to form the Functional Vision Score and is used in disability certification in some countries.",
